# SeiunEngine server - Haxe -> neko
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   haxe server/server.hxml                    # build  -> server/bin/server.n
#   haxe server/server.hxml --no-output        # typecheck only
#   neko server/bin/server.n                   # run
#
# Or use the wrapper scripts:  server\build.ps1   server\start.ps1
#
# Dependencies: Haxe 4.2.5 + neko only. No Node / TypeScript / colyseus-server.
# Compile closure:
#   server/src/online_server/**            <- the server itself (this folder)
#   source/online/backend/schema/**        <- colyseus schema shared with the client
#   source/_online_libs/**                 <- io.colyseus.* / org.msgpack.*
# NOTE: neko (or cpp). `--interp` has no sys.thread.Thread/Mutex, which both the
#       HTTP server and io.colyseus.Connection need.
-cp server/src
-cp source
-cp source/_online_libs
-D server_build
-main online_server.Main
-neko server/bin/server.n
